{"candidateAnswer":"California or salmon roll","evidence":"[D25:8 | 10:14 am on 24 October, 2023] Audrey: Definitely try a California or salmon roll first when trying sushi - they're easier. Mix it up with different sauces and dips too - it makes it more tasty. Enjoy and let me know how it goes!","itemId":"urn:uuid:1a3336d2-86f2-5a6a-8dfa-bc05265eb33e","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:220d7b1a0447f31f80c2fcaac0afc4309cb1930e5f0bc5b3619f20288560758a","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Which type of sushi did Audrey suggest trying first to someone new to sushi?","referenceAnswer":"California or salmon roll","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"220d7b1a0447f31f80c2fcaac0afc4309cb1930e5f0bc5b3619f20288560758a"}}]}